00:01:16.923 --> 00:01:18.642
All right, first of all,

00:01:18.642 --> 00:01:21.567
growing up means that every time you eat

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:24.168
like you live in crusty garbage can

00:01:24.168 --> 00:01:27.081
you feel like you're a crusty garbage can.

00:01:27.081 --> 00:01:28.317
You just eat whatever the f(beep)k

00:01:28.317 --> 00:01:30.221
you want when you're a kid.

00:01:30.221 --> 00:01:33.705
I could shove an entire
18-inch calzone down my throat

00:01:33.705 --> 00:01:36.775
and f(beep)in' hula hoop for hours.

00:01:36.775 --> 00:01:39.700
But now when I shove an
entire 18-inch calzone

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:43.532
down my throat I'm
"disgusting" and "immature"

00:01:43.532 --> 00:01:46.075
and "too old to be going to the hospital

00:01:46.075 --> 00:01:48.338
"for things like this every week."

00:01:48.338 --> 00:01:50.519
All these for my love for calzones.

00:01:50.519 --> 00:01:53.538
Next, grown up hangovers.

00:01:53.538 --> 00:01:56.301
Hangovers when you're
young are just, like,

00:01:56.301 --> 00:02:00.515
soft, gentle goose-feathered
pillow fights.

00:02:00.515 --> 00:02:03.760
Just gently rubbin'
against your face skin.

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:06.941
But grown up hangovers are like if a bear

00:02:06.941 --> 00:02:09.181
came into your bedroom
while you're sleeping

00:02:09.181 --> 00:02:11.317
and just ripped off your scalp.

00:02:11.317 --> 00:02:14.092
Then a bigger, even angrier bear

00:02:14.092 --> 00:02:16.355
comes in and joins the first bear.

00:02:16.355 --> 00:02:20.813
Just gnawing on your worthless,
alcohol ridden brain.

00:02:20.813 --> 00:02:24.922
Also, grown up parties
are the f(beep)ing worst.

00:02:24.922 --> 00:02:27.256
Oh, it's a dinner party.

00:02:27.256 --> 00:02:29.021
You have to wear a bow-tie.

00:02:29.021 --> 00:02:33.523
Talk about khaki pants
and carry a briefcase.

00:02:33.523 --> 00:02:34.923
F(beep)k-off.

00:02:34.923 --> 00:02:37.785
Kids' parties are the f(beep)ing shit.

00:02:37.785 --> 00:02:39.329
I wanna eat cake,

00:02:39.329 --> 00:02:41.047
I wanna drink juice

00:02:41.047 --> 00:02:44.901
and I wanna scream the
lyrics to I Want It That Way

00:02:44.901 --> 00:02:48.569
until I pass out to a pile
of my own sugary vomit.

00:02:48.569 --> 00:02:50.555
Also I'd like to ride a pony,

00:02:50.555 --> 00:02:53.096
if a pony were to be available to me.

00:02:53.096 --> 00:02:55.929
He's a pretty pony named "Felipe."

00:02:55.929 --> 00:02:58.093
Felipe the pony.

00:02:58.093 --> 00:03:01.657
Next, grown up means
that one day you wake up

00:03:01.657 --> 00:03:04.292
and you're tired and that's it.

00:03:04.292 --> 00:03:06.080
You're just tired forever.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.518
You just keep being tired until you die.

00:03:08.518 --> 00:03:12.581
And the only thing that makes
you feel awake is cupcakes.

00:03:12.581 --> 00:03:14.843
Just never stop eating cupcakes

00:03:14.843 --> 00:03:16.422
and you'll be awake forever.

00:03:16.422 --> 00:03:19.207
You'll probably die in like a week but

00:03:19.207 --> 00:03:20.635
what a week.

00:03:20.635 --> 00:03:23.293
Next, makin' friends.

00:03:23.293 --> 00:03:24.558
'Cause when you're a kid,

00:03:24.558 --> 00:03:26.717
all you gotta do is walk up to someone,

00:03:26.717 --> 00:03:28.878
say you like their light-up shoes

00:03:28.878 --> 00:03:30.039
and then bam!

00:03:30.039 --> 00:03:32.976
You're splitting a pack of
Starburst behind the Jungle Gym.

00:03:32.976 --> 00:03:35.576
If you're an adult, what
are you supposed to do?

00:03:35.576 --> 00:03:39.000
Am I supposed to tell you
about my hobbies and interests?

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.883
Are we supposed to go
down to the tennis club,

00:03:42.883 --> 00:03:45.065
play f(beep)ing chess?

00:03:45.065 --> 00:03:47.549
No, I'd never do that.

00:03:47.549 --> 00:03:51.497
Because you're awful and
all grown ups are awful.

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:53.807
And I don't wanna be
f(beep)ing friends with you.

00:03:53.807 --> 00:03:57.522
Next, eating ice cream
isn't even fun anymore

00:03:57.522 --> 00:03:59.101
when you're old.

00:03:59.101 --> 00:04:00.760
When you're a grown up,

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.327
eating ice cream is just a "thing" you do

00:04:03.327 --> 00:04:05.578
to stay busy while you cry.

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:07.030
Also, when you're a grown up,

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:09.966
everything you do to have fun costs money.

00:04:09.966 --> 00:04:12.706
When I was kid, five dollars could last me

00:04:12.706 --> 00:04:14.630
the whole g(beep)n month.

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:17.072
Now five dollars can't buy me shit.

00:04:17.072 --> 00:04:19.232
Five dollar can buy me what?

00:04:19.232 --> 00:04:21.928
Just one big old meatball.

00:04:21.928 --> 00:04:23.670
What good is that gonna do me?

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:26.895
That'll keep me busy for like 15 minutes.

00:04:26.895 --> 00:04:28.312
And then what?

00:04:28.312 --> 00:04:32.375
And finally, being a grown
up means you suddenly have a

00:04:32.375 --> 00:04:36.023
whole bunch of responsibilities
that you never had before.

00:04:36.023 --> 00:04:38.949
Everybody's always yelling
at you to do something.

00:04:38.949 --> 00:04:42.876
You can't just sit on your
couch in Spider-Man underwear

00:04:42.876 --> 00:04:44.777
and drink chocolate milk

00:04:44.777 --> 00:04:47.319
and yell at a cartoon sponge.

00:04:47.319 --> 00:04:49.908
Well guess what?

00:04:49.908 --> 00:04:53.719
I don't give a flappin'
f(beep)k about being an adult.

00:04:53.719 --> 00:04:56.284
And I will drink my chocolate milk

00:04:56.284 --> 00:04:58.722
and I will wear my Spider-Man underwear

00:04:58.722 --> 00:05:00.800
and I will scream at whatever

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:05.188
cartoon sponge I wanna scream
at until the day I die.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:09.497
That is the truth.

